      "content": "it's just hard to find something to \"fill the space\" when there's nothing left to do. i can't go for walks like i used to, i can't even drive to the store easily. it feels like i've already lost my life, i'm just waiting for my body to catch up and realize it. it's exhausting just existing like this.",
